  "captions": [
    {"start": 1.265, "end": 3.825, "lines": ["Hi, thanks again","for doing this and congratulations"]},
    {"start": 3.825, "end": 5.665, "lines": ["on a beautiful launch."]},
    {"start": 5.665, "end": 7.265, "lines": ["My question is for Jared."]},
    {"start": 7.265, "end": 9.505, "lines": ["I noticed this week, earlier this week,"]},
    {"start": 9.505, "end": 13.105, "lines": ["you were at the White House","for the AI Summit, sitting"]},
    {"start": 13.105, "end": 17.345, "lines": ["in the first row and you interacting","with all those high tech executives."]},
    {"start": 17.345, "end": 19.905, "lines": ["I'm wondering","what is your opinion about AI?"]},
    {"start": 19.905, "end": 21.985, "lines": ["It's become very controversial."]},
    {"start": 21.985, "end": 23.825, "lines": ["Do you think it's beneficial?"]},
    {"start": 23.825, "end": 25.345, "lines": ["Do you think it's harmful?"]},
    {"start": 25.345, "end": 29.376, "lines": ["And how do you think","or do you think it will help NASA"]},
    {"start": 29.376, "end": 33.856, "lines": ["Like with the moon base, is it going","to revolutionize the way NASA works?"]},
    {"start": 33.856, "end": 35.176, "lines": ["Thanks."]},
    {"start": 36.896, "end": 38.416, "lines": ["I mean, I was honored to have"]},
    {"start": 38.416, "end": 41.056, "lines": ["an opportunity to join that lunch,","and I made clear"]},
    {"start": 41.056, "end": 44.496, "lines": ["when it was my turn to speak:","I am the space guy here."]},
    {"start": 44.496, "end": 47.496, "lines": ["But if you are interested","in my views, I mean,"]},
    {"start": 48.016, "end": 52.656, "lines": ["what potential superintelligence has,","again, I've described it very publicly"]},
